	(text "Power input: PJ-102A barrel jack is center-positive and rated 2.5 A. +5V is fused, switched, reverse-polarity protected by Q1, TVS-clamped, then feeds the daughterboard power connector and MOD1 3.3 V buck module."
		(at 19.812 216.154 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "14bf30dd-2788-4d12-9324-5d1036d87847")
	)
	(text "SRAM sockets U21-U27 complete 4 MB main SRAM bank with U20"
		(at 424.18 13.97 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6ea7594c-89e6-4562-b9c4-939507b0ba4d")
	)
	(text "Stage 1 subsystem: W65C816S, 8 MHz 3.3 V clock, MCP130 reset, 74HC573 bank latch, one AS6C4008 SRAM, SST39VF040 boot Flash. RP2350/video not populated here."
		(at 20 10 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9276684f-9c4a-4bcb-ad91-9546acea0422")
	)
	(text "Rev A decode: U7 divides low 4 MB into 512 KB SRAM banks; U6 detects bank $00. Flash overlays $00:8000-$FFFF for reset vectors. U9 disables RAM0 while ROM is active. MEM_OE_N=!RWB, MEM_WE_N=RWB."
		(at 20 14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f59f84cc-45d1-4d18-a701-c890fbcac306")
	)
